The total cost to fully charge the staff with 40,000 soul and 100,000 chaos runes is {{NoCoins|{{GEP|Soul rune|40000}}+{{GEP|Chaos rune|100000}}|c}}. Assuming non-stop use, with one cast every 3 seconds equaling 1200 casts per hour, the shadow costs {{NoCoins|({{GEP|Soul rune|2}}+{{GEP|Chaos rune|5}})* 1200|c}} per hour to use. 

Players can uncharge the staff whenever and wherever they choose, getting all of their runes back.

==Maximum hit==
The [[Maximum Magic hit|maximum hit]] dealt by the staff is dependent on the player's current visible [[Magic]] level; the formula is as follows. At level 0, the max hit is 1.

<math> \text{Max Hit} = \left\lfloor \frac{\text{Magic}}{3} + 1 \right\rfloor </math>

Note that any [[magic damage]] bonuses are applied after the base max hit is calculated.

