==Trivia==
* Tumeken's shadow was proposed as a replacement for the [[Tumeken's heka]] as the "standout reward" for the raid in a [[Update:Tombs of Amascut: Reward Changes|newspost]] on [[13 May]] [[2022]], due to player feedback on the desire for a magic weapon that would "redefine Magic as a combat style just as the Scythe [of Vitur] and Twisted Bow did." It was then polled in the [[Poll:Tombs of Amascut Reward Changes|Tombs of Amascut Reward Changes]] [[poll]] with the caveat that the heka would be replaced with Tumeken's shadow if it passed the poll; this came to pass with 90.9% support.
*"{{RSL|Tumeken's shadow}}" is also the name of a quest NPC fought in the ''RuneScape 3'' quest {{RSL|Missing My Mummy}}.

